WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.690 --> 00:00:02.360
Hey, David.

00:00:02.360 --> 00:00:06.910
Trump is talking about not knowing the results
of this election four days, weeks or months.

00:00:06.910 --> 00:00:10.269
When do you think we will know who won the
2020 election?

00:00:10.269 --> 00:00:15.929
So about three weeks ago, I would have said
to you it could be seven days after November

00:00:15.929 --> 00:00:16.929
3rd.

00:00:16.929 --> 00:00:19.700
So, like by November 10th, we will know the
results.

00:00:19.700 --> 00:00:25.180
With every passing day, I actually think we
will probably know the results not much later

00:00:25.180 --> 00:00:26.260
than November 4th.

00:00:26.260 --> 00:00:32.020
I think the day after the election, I don't
believe this is going to be close enough that

00:00:32.020 --> 00:00:34.899
we will need a full week to know the results.

00:00:34.899 --> 00:00:39.069
Now, if and whether Donald Trump concedes
if he loses.

00:00:39.069 --> 00:00:41.469
That's a very different question.

00:00:41.469 --> 00:00:46.670
But I am increasingly blue when you look at
there are basically the issue is absentee

00:00:46.670 --> 00:00:51.660
ballots in a normal election, according to
the Brookings Institute.

00:00:51.660 --> 00:00:57.179
About 30 percent of the ballots that are cast
would be expected to be mailed in.

00:00:57.179 --> 00:00:59.659
It is now expected to be more than half.

00:00:59.659 --> 00:01:05.250
And there are basically three scenarios for
when states can count absentee ballots.

00:01:05.250 --> 00:01:09.680
States can just start counting as they come
in before Election Day, meaning they're already

00:01:09.680 --> 00:01:12.250
counting mail in ballots in some states.

00:01:12.250 --> 00:01:18.720
There are states where the absentee ballots
can start to be counted at the in the morning

00:01:18.720 --> 00:01:21.690
before the polls close, even if they have.

00:01:21.690 --> 00:01:25.590
Been mailed in, so November 3rd in the morning,
people start voting in person and they start

00:01:25.590 --> 00:01:27.540
opening and counting absentee ballots.

00:01:27.540 --> 00:01:33.290
And then the third scenario is only when the
polls close can you start counting absentee

00:01:33.290 --> 00:01:34.290
ballots.

00:01:34.290 --> 00:01:40.800
The vast majority of states that matter are
not in that last category.

00:01:40.800 --> 00:01:42.710
And it escapes me now.

00:01:42.710 --> 00:01:49.270
But there are two states I, I want to say
Pennsylvania and one other of the states that

00:01:49.270 --> 00:01:54.310
are in the last category where the results
may take a while to have from the absentee

00:01:54.310 --> 00:01:55.770
ballots.

00:01:55.770 --> 00:01:59.240
There are very few that have a shot at making
a difference in the results.

00:01:59.240 --> 00:02:01.610
Now, Pennsylvania certainly is one of them.

00:02:01.610 --> 00:02:06.430
And the reason why I am increasingly thinking
it's not going to take a week to know the

00:02:06.430 --> 00:02:11.830
results is that Pennsylvania is going more
and more in the direction of Joe Biden this

00:02:11.830 --> 00:02:12.850
week.

00:02:12.850 --> 00:02:19.300
In fact, we had polls saying Joe Biden is
up eight in Pennsylvania or even more.

00:02:19.300 --> 00:02:21.060
And that is the one.

00:02:21.060 --> 00:02:22.060
There may be one other.

00:02:22.060 --> 00:02:26.690
That is one of the few states that could be
a deciding state that has this.

00:02:26.690 --> 00:02:28.660
We don't start counting until the polls close.

00:02:28.660 --> 00:02:29.930
Sort of scenario.

00:02:29.930 --> 00:02:32.650
And I may even be misremembering that.

00:02:32.650 --> 00:02:42.490
Bottom line, the gist is I think the election
results being delayed will have more to do

00:02:42.490 --> 00:02:49.310
with whether Donald Trump successfully uses
lawyers and courts to slow down or stop the

00:02:49.310 --> 00:02:55.270
counting of absentee ballots and or to get
ballots dismissed, which he successfully did

00:02:55.270 --> 00:02:58.280
in Iowa this week or last week.

00:02:58.280 --> 00:03:02.810
I think it will have more to do with that
than the actual time it will take to count

00:03:02.810 --> 00:03:03.810
the ballots.

00:03:03.810 --> 00:03:10.180
I think that if the ballots are allowed to
be counted normally without interference,

00:03:10.180 --> 00:03:13.590
that this is going to be an election where
we know the results on November 4th.

00:03:13.590 --> 00:03:17.630
Now, that could be like midnight as November
5th is starting.

00:03:17.630 --> 00:03:22.600
I think the real chance for a delay would
be Donald Trump creating one through using

00:03:22.600 --> 00:03:25.060
lawyers, courts, lawsuits and the like.

00:03:25.060 --> 00:03:26.410
Let's hope it doesn't happen.

00:03:26.410 --> 00:03:27.690
Let's hope it is.

00:03:27.690 --> 00:03:34.459
So a blow out for Joe Biden, which depends
on us that it doesn't even matter that even

00:03:34.459 --> 00:03:37.970
on election night, it becomes clear that Joe
Biden won.

00:03:37.970 --> 00:03:39.340
It could happen.

00:03:39.340 --> 00:03:40.430
It could happen.

00:03:40.430 --> 00:05:07.370
The next few weeks will determine ultimately
what does happen.

